    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, Print, Conquer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build bases, set up money printers to print money, defend them from other players looking to take it over. Clear waves of zombies to discover resources, outdo your opponents, and reach the leaderboard for special rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Exclusive Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be number one on the leaderboard to redeem rewards seen by the best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Secure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install cash printers to make money, but don't get too complacent\u2014there are other players who will try to steal from you. Build and defend your base to guard your loot and resources against incursions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal and Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invade other players' bases and steal their cash printers to claim their profits. Outsmart your opponents and take control.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, Print, Conquer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build bases, set up money printers to print money, defend them from other players looking to take it over. Clear waves of zombies to discover resources, outdo your opponents, and reach the leaderboard for special rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Exclusive Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be number one on the leaderboard to redeem rewards seen by the best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Secure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install cash printers to make money, but don't get too complacent\u2014there are other players who will try to steal from you. Build and defend your base to guard your loot and resources against incursions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal and Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invade other players' bases and steal their cash printers to claim their profits. Outsmart your opponents and take control.</p>",
    "short_description": "Heistland is a multiplayer FPS where you collect cash, fight off zombies and players. Team up with friends, build your base, protect your loot and win exclusive rewards.",
